;PALASM Design Description
; pds2v test: MACH111 resource violations (checks 3 and 4).
; EXPECT-EXIT: 1
; EXPECT: error: block A needs 28 inputs from the switch matrix, only 26
; EXPECT: error: XOR5 needs 16 product terms
; EXPECT: warning: WIDE needs 9 product terms
; EXPECT: error: EXPL: equation too complex
; EXPECT: error: T4.TRST must be a single product term
; EXPECT: error: bank IO8-15 needs 4 output-enable terms, only 2
; EXPECT: warning: block A has one async reset term shared by all its flip-flops, but R1, R2 use different .RSTF
; EXPECT: warning: block A: the async reset (.RSTF of R1) also acts on the flip-flops without .RSTF: R3
; EXPECT: error: R2.SETF must be a single product term
; EXPECT: warning: POS needs 12 product terms

CHIP     BADRES  MACH111

PIN  5   CLK
PIN  4   IA
PIN  7   IB
PIN  26  IC
PIN  27  ID
PIN  29  IE
PIN  18  B0                     ; block B pins all used as inputs
PIN  19  B1
PIN  20  B2
PIN  21  B3
PIN  22  B4
PIN  23  B5
PIN  24  B6
PIN  25  B7
PIN  30  B8
PIN  31  B9
PIN  32  B10
PIN  33  B11
PIN  34  B12
PIN  35  B13
PIN  36  B14
PIN  37  B15
PIN  2   A0
PIN  3   A1

PIN  40  BIG    COMBINATORIAL   ; 27 block inputs
PIN  41  XOR5   COMBINATORIAL   ; 16 product terms in either polarity
PIN  42  WIDE   COMBINATORIAL   ; 9 product terms (warning)
PIN  43  R1     REGISTERED
PIN  44  R2     REGISTERED
PIN  1   R3     REGISTERED
PIN  8   T1     COMBINATORIAL   ; bank IO8-15: too many / bad OE terms
PIN  9   T2     COMBINATORIAL
PIN  10  T3     COMBINATORIAL
PIN  11  T4     COMBINATORIAL
PIN  12  T5     COMBINATORIAL
PIN  13  EXPL   COMBINATORIAL   ; too big to expand in either polarity
PIN  14  POS    COMBINATORIAL   ; f explodes, /f has 12 product terms

EQUATIONS
BIG  = IA * IB * IC * ID * IE * A0
     * B0 * B1 * B2 * B3 * B4 * B5 * B6 * B7
     * B8 * B9 * B10 * B11 * B12 * B13 * B14 * B15
     * XOR5 * WIDE * R1 * R2 * R3
XOR5 = IA :+: IB :+: IC :+: ID :+: IE
WIDE = B0*B1 + B2*B3 + B4*B5 + B6*B7 + B8*B9 + B10*B11 + B12*B13 + B14*B15
     + A0*A1
EXPL = B0 :+: B1 :+: B2 :+: B3 :+: B4 :+: B5 :+: B6 :+: B7
       :+: B8 :+: B9 :+: B10 :+: B11 :+: B12
POS  = (B0 + B1) * (B2 + B3) * (B4 + B5) * (B6 + B7) * (B8 + B9) * (B10 + B11)
     * (B12 + B13) * (B14 + B15) * (A0 + A1) * (IA + IB) * (IC + ID) * (IE + A1)

R1 := IA
R2 := IB
R3 := IC
R1.CLKF = CLK
R2.CLKF = CLK
R3.CLKF = CLK
R1.RSTF = IA
R2.RSTF = IB
R2.SETF = IA + IB

T1 = IA
T2 = IA
T3 = IA
T4 = IA
T5 = IA
T1.TRST = IA
T2.TRST = IB
T3.TRST = IC * /ID
T4.TRST = IA + IB
